OL,3,GNEWSARising fuel prices 'cost tow truck
OL,4,Abusiness #10k'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRising fuel prices are hitting
OL,7,Fbusinesses, with the owner of a vehicle
OL,8,Fbreakdown service saying prices had
OL,9,Fcost his business between #9,000 and
OL,10,F#11,000.
OL,12,FOliver du Feu said it had a "big
OL,13,Fimpact" because trucks, which held
OL,14,Fbetween 80 and 120 litres of diesel,
OL,15,Fwere filled up every two days.
OL,17,FIt comes as a proposition to lower fuel
OL,18,Fduty - currently about 65p per litre -
OL,19,Fby 10p per litre between October and
OL,20,FDecember was withdrawn.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
